 "name": "Kílómetragjald (km fee on trucks and trailers of 10 t or more)",
 "law": "Lög um olíugjald og kílómetragjald nr. 87/2004: the km fee on trucks (not buses) and trailers of 10,000 kg or more, registered in Iceland or abroad, each by its own gjaldþyngd (its permissible total weight; no maximum by axles), ISK 0.40 per km at 10,000-11,000 kg to 17.84 above 31,000 kg in 2025, as Skatturinn (Iceland Revenue and Customs) gives the year's amounts. The motor vehicle and the trailer each pay on their own (give motor_mass_kg, trailer_mass_kg and motor_axles). The special km fee on vehicles for special use is left out. Diesel paid olíugjald, a fuel excise, besides: not a road charge here.",
